<title>USA: Res-Care to buy Premier Rehabilitation.</title>
<headline>Res-Care to buy Premier Rehabilitation.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Res-Care Inc, which provides services for people with mental retardation and other developmental disabilities, said Wednesday it agreed to acquire Premier Rehabilitation Centers.</p>
<p>Res-Care said it will acquire Premier, a brain injury services provider, for about 409,000 shares of Res-Care stock.</p>
<p>The deal, which is expected to close on January 3, will boost Res-Care's 1997 results, the company said.</p>
<p>Premier generates annual revenues of $6.5 million and provides service in St. Louis, Chicago and Miami.</p>
</text>
